  "en:repo.learningsIntro": "Claudio notes these itself when a run had to overcome an obstacle, such as a field without a label or a cookie banner. Every later review, test and analysis receives the latest X. Delete whatever is wrong.",
  "en:repo.learningsTitle": "Agent learnings",
  "en:repo.lessonsIntro": "Created when someone dismisses a finding with a reason. Every later review receives them as “intended, do not report”.",
  "en:repo.lessonsTitle": "Learned decisions",
