  "en:repo.noKb": "No knowledge base yet",
  "en:repo.noKbText": "In an analysis Claudio reads the code and walks through the running app screen by screen. The result is five documents: overview, modules, routes, an app map with the expected behaviour of each screen, and notes. Reviews use them to find affected areas faster and to spot deviations from previous behaviour.",
